../energy/pbc.c:43:	volume += pbc->basis[0][1]*(pbc->basis[1][2]*pbc->basis[2][0] - pbc->basis[1][0]*pbc->basis[2][2]);
../energy/pbc.c:44:	volume += pbc->basis[0][2]*(pbc->basis[1][0]*pbc->basis[2][1] - pbc->basis[2][1]*pbc->basis[2][0]);
> volume agrees with a dot b cross c formula.

../energy/pbc.c:56:	pbc->reciprocal_basis[0][0] = inverse_volume*(pbc->basis[1][1]*pbc->basis[2][2] - pbc->basis[1][2]*pbc->basis[2][1]);
