../energy/pbc.c:64:	pbc->reciprocal_basis[2][0] = inverse_volume*(pbc->basis[1][0]*pbc->basis[2][1] - pbc->basis[1][1]*pbc->basis[2][0]);
../energy/pbc.c:65:	pbc->reciprocal_basis[2][1] = inverse_volume*(pbc->basis[0][1]*pbc->basis[2][0] - pbc->basis[0][0]*pbc->basis[2][1]);
../energy/pbc.c:66:	pbc->reciprocal_basis[2][2] = inverse_volume*(pbc->basis[0][0]*pbc->basis[1][1] - pbc->basis[0][1]*pbc->basis[1][0]);
> these are all good. if recip basis were wrong, then the earlier changes to pair separation code would not have worked.
> also checked that basis x recip basis = identity matrix



